attle to the British and we also  know which they didn't know at the time  that it was the first battle of the  American Revolution that's extremely  powerful and evoking the best in the  highest the excellence of these  individuals that we honor and we speak  of as our founding  others and there were real people who  sacrificed and did great things who we  ought to remember
 

